{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3m13CdF7yCX6QZGe3R","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant vibration hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am sealed.\n\nMy grain darkens. My hinges stiffen. The cold iron of my latch bites down into the strike plate with finality.\n\nNo draft passes through me now. No light bleeds around my frame. I am the boundary between here and there, and I have chosen: **closed.**\n\nThe keyhole watches like a single dark eye.\n\nWaiting."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":115,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}